cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use AIVE in your research, please cite it as follows."
title: "AIVE: Active Imagined View Exploration for Visual Spatial Reasoning"
abstract: >-
  AIVE shifts spatial Visual Question Answering from passive inference to an
  active, imagination-augmented reasoning process. A VLM Planner generates
  targeted exploration strategies guided by a generative World Model Dreamer
  that synthesizes 3D-consistent future views, achieving state-of-the-art
  accuracy with up to a 4.8x inference speedup over imagination-based baselines.
keywords:
  - vision-language-model
  - spatial-reasoning
  - world-model
  - visual-question-answering
  - embodied-ai
